# EBR (positive-b) reproducibility artifacts — preserve exact on-disk bytes so a
# reader's sha256 of each file matches the deposited paper §8 / AEAL-ledger
# provenance (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.20564080). Disabling text normalization keeps
# the recorded CRLF line endings (e.g. lean/EBR_uplift.lean = 7acb1a58,
# transfer_hypothesis.py = 3e84f22d); without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# them to LF and the published shas drift.
/lean/EBR_uplift.lean -text
/sectorial/** -text
